Search documents
post
https://api.icount.co.il/api/v3.php/doc/search
Request
Body

application/json

sid
string
Session ID

client_id
integer
Client ID

custom_client_id
string
Custom Client ID (from external system)

vat_id
number
Client VAT ID

email
string
Client email

client_name
string
Client name

client_ids
array[integer]
Client IDs list (for multi-client search)

custom_client_ids
array[string]
Custom Client IDs list (for multi-client search)

user_id
integer
User ID of the employee who issued document(s)

username
string
Username of the employee who issued document(s)

user_email
string
Email address of the employee who issued document(s)

doc_date
string<date>
Document date

start_date
string<date>
Start date

end_date
string<date>
End date

start_ts
string<date-time>
Start timestamp

end_ts
string<date-time>
End timestamp

paydate
string<date>
Last payment date

start_paydate
string<date>
Start paydate

end_paydate
string<date>
End paydate

duedate
string<date>
Due date

start_duedate
string<date>
Start duedate

end_duedate
string<date>
End duedate

income_type_id
integer
Income type ID

status
integer
Document status. 0=open, 1=closed, 2=partially closed. Note that querying for open documents will also include results that are partially closed

doctype
stringinteger

one of: string
Document type(s) to query

docnum
stringinteger

one of: string
Document number(s) to query

cc_last4
string
Last 4 digits of crdit-card number

confirmation_code
string
Credit-card transaction confirmation code

pp_txn_id
string
PayPal transaction ID

max_results
integer
Maximum number of results [0-1000].

Default:
100
sort_field
string
Sorting: Field (dateissued|timeissued|docnum|paydate|client_name).

Default:
dateissued
sort_order
string
Sorting: Order (ASC|DESC).

Default:
ASC
offset
integer
Paging: Offset (0+).
Default:
0

limit
integer
Paging: Limit number of returned results (0+). 0 = no limit.
Default:
0

detail_level
integer
Level of detail (0-10). 0=doctype+docnum, 1=+date+client_id+currency+total, 2+=client details+detailed totals, 3=+employee+income_type, 4+=totals translated into foreign currency where applicable ... 9=Everything but items+payment details, 10=Everything..
Default:
1

get_base_docs
boolean
Populate base documents (based_on / based_on_this). If enabled, returns doctype+docnum pairs for each base document.
Default:
false

Responses
200
OK

